Source: https://github.com/nikic/php-parser/blob/master/doc/2_Usage_of_basic_components.markdown

The `NameResolver` node visitor helps in working with namespaced code by resolving names to their fully qualified forms. It tracks aliases and namespaces to determine the correct resolution. After running `NameResolver`, most names become fully qualified, except for unqualified function and constant names which are resolved at runtime. It also adds a `namespacedName` subnode to declarations for namespaced names.
